-liangshu","book_id":"b-liangshu-029","chapter_id":"c-liangshu-029-xiaoxu-complete","source_id":"s-liangshu-029-xiaoxu-complete-ws1538079","paragraph_id":"c-liangshu-029-xiaoxu-complete:p002","quote":"續少英果，膂力絕人，馳射游獵，應發命中。高祖常歎曰：「此我之任城也。」嘗與臨賀王正德及胡貴通、趙伯超等馳射于高祖前，續冠于諸人，高祖大悅。三年，爲使持節、都督雍、梁、秦、沙四州諸軍事、西中郎將、雍州刺史。七年，加宣毅將軍。中大通二年，又爲使持節、都督雍、梁、秦、沙四州諸軍事、平北將軍、寧蠻校尉、雍州刺史，給鼓吹一部。續多聚馬仗，畜養驍雄，金帛內盈，倉廩外實。四年，遷安北將軍。大同元年，爲使持節、都督江州諸軍事、安南將軍、江州刺史。三年，徵爲護軍將軍、領石頭戍軍事。五年，爲驃騎將軍、開府儀同三司。又出爲使持節、都督荊郢司雍南北秦梁巴華九州諸軍事、荊州刺史。中大同二年，薨於州，時年四十四。贈司空、散騎常侍、驃騎大將軍，鼓吹一部，諡曰威。長子安嗣。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-liangshu-029-xiaoxu-complete:p002:m0322","object_person_mention_id":"c-liangshu-029-xiaoxu-complete:p002:m0000","source_term":"長子安嗣"}],"status":"contextual_provisional","human_reviewed":false,"interpretation_note":"梁傳及殿本明載長子安。南史所見憑、應另依該書。"}}],"source_mention_summary":[{"source_id":"s-liangshu-029-xiaoxu-complete-ws1538079","work_id":"w-liangshu","book_id":"b-liangshu-029","chapter_id":"c-liangshu-029-xiaoxu-complete","raw_mention_count":1,"mention_ids":["c-liangshu-029-xiaoxu-complete:p002:m0322"],"paragraph_ids":["c-liangshu-029-xiaoxu-complete:p002"],"table_cell_ids":[],"occurrence_groups":[{"canonical_mention_id":"c-liangshu-029-xiaoxu-complete:p002:m0322","mention_ids":["c-liangshu-029-xiaoxu-complete:p002:m0322"],"kind":"paragraph"}],"mention_count":1,"duplicate_mention_count":0,"paragraph_occurrence_count":1,"table_occurrence_count":0,"passage_count":1,"passage_count_scope":"annotation_containers_not_independent_witness_passages","count_explanation":"1處獨立位置，1個原始錨點；0項為同底本同位置重出。頻次不是來源權威度。"}],"most_mentioned_source_ids":["s-liangshu-029-xiaoxu-complete-ws1538079"],"mention_count_policy":{"scope":"independent_fixed_witness_occurrences","raw_mentions_preserved":true,"passage_count_scope":"annotation_containers","explanation":"頻次依已驗同底本同位置去重；原始錨點完整保留，頻次不代表來源權威度。","included_kinds":["paragraph","table_cell"],"identity_policy":"contextual_provisional","ties":"all_maxima","frequency_is_not_authority":true},"kinship_interpr